    "text": "Let n = k 2 . Let σ ∈ Sn be the product of k disjoint cycles, of lengths\n1, 3, 5, . . . , 2k − 1. Find the limiting proportion of odd entries in the σ-column of the\ncharacter table of Sn .\n    For some background, see pages 1005–1006 in (D. Gluck, Proc. Amer. Math. Soc.,\n147 (2019), 1005–1011).                                                            D. Gluck",
